		(comment 1 "HV-PELV reinforced 1000 V DC (ECO-10); barriers listed on the cover")
		(comment 2 "Schematics authored by Chinmoy Bhuyan")
		(comment 3 "Sheet 1")
		(comment 4 "Not bench-validated. Values: sim/out/pv_design/cell_spec.json; checks: design_check()")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "gdrv.channel() rev 5: NSI6651ASC-Q1 + UCC14241-Q1 +18/-3.5 V,\n3.75/2.5 ohm + Kelvin R per device, AO3400A clamps,\nSC booster 22R, interlock with PWM3, DESAT to the drain"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.5 142 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "161c64f9-030c-5cc0-945f-bdce84e37313")
	)
	(text "AN1 = LEM LA 150-P on inductor lead A: 20.0 mV/A differential, CM 1.25 V, < 1 ohm, linear +/-114 A, 0.52 us, 0.0759 A/LSB at the CTRL. Bus OV: no local comparator (CTRL path 26 us -> 1115 V, 0.835 x V_DSS)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 240 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1cd3d3e5-a373-5378-956e-016fe8d76e00")
	)
	(text "Rev C0  |  2026-10-04  |  Schematics authored by Chinmoy Bhuyan  |  25 kW (27.5 kW max) bidirectional 4-switch buck-boost cell, 2 x 4 x SG2M040170HJ"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "21f0db96-6f7f-5c87-9232-de8c3b7bdb42")
	)
	(text "Fail-safe off: open, unplugged, unpowered or tri-stated pairs read <= -0.29 V = LOW; RDY push-pull; +24V removal drops RDY at >= 19.7 V; +3V3 or +5V loss -> drivers off (VCC1 UVLO / EN low). No bootstrap: 100 % duty OK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b21e6de-4b07-5605-a7fe-853cf3e02314")
	)
	(text "40-way CELL contract to CTRL-C2000, +24V = safety-switched +24V_GD;\nLMR36015 3.3 V + 5 V (driver logic side), TPS3710 on RDY, ID 4.99k, AGND tie"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.5 54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "78149b60-75e8-51f1-a802-64e786a98f56")
	)
	(text "Local trips: inductor OC +/-72.2 A (68.5-76.0 A), gates off 0.94 us (PWM) / 1.73 us (EN) vs 3.66 us allowed; heatsink OT 95.0 C (92.3-97.9 C), open probe trips; DESAT per driver; CTRL backup peak 106.0 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 236 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7d9eb531-e6d8-531e-8dff-4259518ac0f3")
	)
	(text "AN1 = LEM LA 150-P + driver, AN2/AN3 = heatsink/winding temperature,\nOC window + heatsink OT comparators, 2.5 V reference, NTC pass-through"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.5 98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8b2963fc-0d3c-5f9f-82e6-e431ccb4a72a")
	)
	(text "Domains: PELV, HV, GD_S1..S4, PE. Isolators: NSI6651ASC-Q1 + UCC14241-Q1 x 4, LA 150-P, L_CELL. CONFORMAL COATING to PD1 (IEC 60664-3) over every HV-PELV barrier part and the power stage (IC-17, IC-22). 1000 V DC (ECO-10)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 248 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8c37ac55-9e92-5066-928b-a51d38b25ad7")
	)
	(text "gdrv.channel() rev 5: NSI6651ASC-Q1 + UCC14241-Q1 +18/-3.5 V,\n3.75/2.5 ohm + Kelvin R per device, AO3400A clamps,\nSC booster 22R, interlock with PWM2, DESAT to the drain"
